{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/042-jing-nv/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0003-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/042-jing-nv/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0003-1/data.json","title":"毛詩注疏 · 靜女其孌貽我彤管彤管有煒說懌女美 · 毛传","description":"風 · 邶風 · 静女 · 《毛詩注疏》关于“靜女其孌貽我彤管彤管有煒說懌女美”的注脚：「靜女其孌，貽我彤管」。既有靜德，又有美色，又能遺我以古人之法，可以配人君也。古者后夫人必有女史彤管之法，事無大小，記以成法。箋云：彤管，筆赤管…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"042-jing-nv","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","glossId":"0003-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/042-jing-nv/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0003-1","poem":{"id":"042-jing-nv","title":"静女","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"beifeng","path":["風","邶風","静女"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"靜女其姝","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"俟我於城隅","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"愛而不見","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"搔首踟躕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"靜女其孌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"貽我彤管","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"彤管有煒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"說懌女美","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"自牧歸荑","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"洵美且異","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"匪女之爲美","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"美人之貽","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","title":"毛詩注疏","authors":["毛亨","鄭氏","孔穎達"],"contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","era":"漢唐","publicationYear":653,"carrier":"TXT"},"annotation":{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"靜女其孌貽我彤管彤管有煒說懌女美","targetNotes":"次章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《毛詩正義/卷二》靜女次章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"text":"「靜女其孌，貽我彤管」。既有靜德，又有美色，又能遺我以古人之法，可以配人君也。古者后夫人必有女史彤管之法，事無大小，記以成法。箋云：彤管，筆赤管也。「彤管有煒，說懌女美」。煒，赤貌。彤管以赤心正人也。箋云：「說懌」當作「說釋」。赤管煒煒然，女史以之說釋妃妾之德，美之。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"篇序","title":"靜女刺時也衛君無道夫人無德","href":"/shijing/gloss/042-jing-nv/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0001-1","isC